tools/kernel-viewer/testdata/

# Local working documents and editor/tool config. These live in the
# working tree but are never part of the crate, and must not be picked up
# by a `git add -A`. Cargo.toml's `exclude` keeps them out of the package
# as well, in case one is ever tracked deliberately.
02-phaios-bootstrap.md
03-phase3-prompt.md
phase2-design-brief.md
.claude/
